   "description": "The Stargazer 1.0 automatic watch is a 39mm stainless steel tool watch powered by the reliable Seiko NH35 automatic movement, designed for everyday wear and long-term durability. The 316L stainless steel case features a screw-down crown and case back with water-resistant gaskets, delivering 200 meters of water resistance for swimming, travel, and daily use. A large dial is accented with painted indices filled with blue lume, while a precise half-second track enhances legibility and time setting accuracy. Custom-designed hands glow bright green, creating high contrast for excellent nighttime readability. The watch is protected by an AR-coated sapphire crystal, offering superior scratch resistance and clarity. With a versatile 20mm lug width, the Stargazer 1.0 works exceptionally well on virtually any strap. It comes standard with a premium leather strap and/or a Milanese bracelet, making it a true strap-friendly automatic watch. Balanced proportions—including a 48mm lug-to-lug and 14mm case thickness—ensure comfort on a wide range of wrist sizes. Backed by a 1-year warranty, the Stargazer 1.0 is a durable, versatile automatic watch built for daily wear. Every Stargazer watch comes with a free canvas watch roll. Movement Automatic Seiko NH35 Water Resistance 200M Case Material 316L Stainless Steel Crystal AR Coated Sapphire Glass Case Size 39mm Lug Width 20mm Case Thickness 14mm Lug to Lug 48mm Face Painted Gradient Luminescence Blue and Green Crown Screw Down Warranty 1 Year",
